# Tracked pictures of the project and its docs (2026-11-10: 24 tracked PNGs were ignored, so a new
# one next to them was silently left out of `git add -A`).
!assets/**/*.png
!docs/**/*.png
# Asset catalogs are source: on 2026-11-10 the AppIcon @2x files were found untracked
# (ignored by *.png), so worktrees and clean clones built an icon without Retina sizes.
!**/*.xcassets/**/*.png
